{"name":"Silverfish","hex":"#8d95aa","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"silverfish","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Certain insects\nA small wingless insect of species Lepisma saccharinum, with silvery scales; a type of bristletail.\nOther similar insects in the family Lepismatidae, including:\nCtenolepisma lineata (four-lined silverfish).\nCtenolepisma longicaudata (grey silverfish).","A small wingless insect of species Lepisma saccharinum, with silvery scales; a type of bristletail."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/silverfish"}],"entries":[{"title":"Silverfish","blocks":[{"text":"The silverfish is a species of small, primitive, wingless insect in the order Zygentoma. Its common name derives from the insect's silvery light grey colour, combined with the fish-like appearance of its movements. The scientific name indicates that the silverfish's diet consists of carbohydrates such as sugar or starches. While the common name silverfish is used throughout the global literature to refer to various species of Zygentoma, the Entomological Society of America restricts use of the term solely to Lepisma saccharinum."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/LepismaSaccharina.jpg/330px-LepismaSaccharina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silverfish","wikidata":"Q26842"},{"title":"Silverfish (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Silverfish were a UK-based indie rock band which formed in the late 1980s and first performed in Camden in 1988. The band split up in 1993."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Silverfish_-_Lesley_%26_Chris.jpg/330px-Silverfish_-_Lesley_%26_Chris.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silverfish_(band)","wikidata":"Q7516685"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Lepisma_saccharina.jpg/500px-Lepisma_saccharina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Lepisma_saccharina.jpg/500px-Lepisma_saccharina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A silverfish","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALepisma_saccharina.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Silverfish_head_close-up.jpg/500px-Silverfish_head_close-up.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Silverfish_head_close-up.jpg/1280px-Silverfish_head_close-up.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Silverfish_head_close-up.jpg/500px-Silverfish_head_close-up.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Silverfish head close-up","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASilverfish_head_close-up.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Nutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg/500px-Nutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Nutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg/1280px-Nutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Nutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg/500px-Nutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pages in a book damaged by silverfish that consumed portions of it.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANutritional_traces_of_silverfishs_in_a_book.jpg"},{"srcse